    {
      "itemId": "7f1e714c-1b8b-4c87-bb96-a16b120faa94",
      "text": "After receiving 44 parcels: 20 + 44 = 64. Each of the three rounds divides equally among 4 rooms and keeps one share, so 64 ÷ 4 ÷ 4 ÷ 4 = 1 parcel.\n\n1",
      "toolCalls": 1,
      "error": null
    },
    {
